{
  "_comment": [
    "Golden-image cases. Each renders through the real emulator binary and is compared",
    "pixel for pixel against the committed PNG next to this file.",
    "",
    "Frames come from emulator/fixtures/, which is regenerated from the backend's own",
    "aircraft fixtures by `just export-frames` — so a change to units, colours or field",
    "selection lands here rather than drifting silently.",
    "",
    "Scale 6 keeps the files small while still showing the LED gap. Bloom is off",
    "everywhere except the one case that exists to exercise it."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {"name": "nearest_ryanair", "frame": "ryanair.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "nearest_ryanair_scrolled", "frame": "ryanair.json", "time_ms": 3000},
    {"name": "nearest_distant", "frame": "distant.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "nearest_military", "frame": "military.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "nearest_helicopter", "frame": "helicopter.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "nearest_no_route", "frame": "no_route.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "empty_sky", "frame": "empty.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "error_offline", "frame": "error.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "tracking_progress", "frame": "tracking.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "metric_units", "frame": "metric.json", "time_ms": 0},

    {"name": "scroll_head", "frame": "scrolling.json", "time_ms": 0},
    {"name": "scroll_middle", "frame": "scrolling.json", "time_ms": 2500},
    {"name": "scroll_tail", "frame": "scrolling.json", "time_ms": 6000},

    {"name": "dim_night_brightness", "frame": "ryanair.json", "time_ms": 0, "brightness": 12},
